    <string name="onboarding_notification_title">Why Arthix needs notification access</string>
    <string name="onboarding_notification_body">Arthix reads UPI payment notifications (GPay, PhonePe, Paytm) to automatically fill in the amount and payee after you shake your phone — so you never have to type it in.\n\nArthix only ever looks at notifications from your UPI apps. Everything else — messages, OTPs, other apps — is never read, stored, or sent anywhere. All matching happens on your phone; nothing leaves your device.\n\nOn the next screen, Android will ask you to confirm this access. Tap Arthix, then turn the toggle on.</string>
